# Replacements for Edit-Color

*plugin* `color-input`

## Insert the expression bar after the color picker

*Description* `Insert the expression bar after the color picker`

*Find* => `colorBar`
```js
$createElement("div", {
  class: "dcg-color-picker-container",
  ____
  })
```

*Replace* `colorBar` with
```js
DesModder.replaceElement(
  () => __colorBar__,
  () => DSM.colorInput?.replaceColorView
)
```